{
  "page": 565,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5287,
      "text": "We will soon brand him on the snout[3].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5288,
      "text": "Indeed, We have tested them [i.e., the Makkans] as We tested the people of the garden when they swore to harvest its fruits in the early morning,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5289,
      "text": "and made no exception [by saying: if Allah wills][4].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5290,
      "text": "Then it was struck by an affliction from your Lord while they were asleep,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5291,
      "text": "and it turned to ashes [as black as night].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5292,
      "text": "Then in the early morning they called out to one another:",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5293,
      "text": "“Go early to your garden if you really wish to harvest.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5294,
      "text": "So they set out, whispering to one another,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5295,
      "text": "“Not a single poor person should enter your garden today.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5296,
      "text": "And they left early, fully determined to stick to their plan[5].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5297,
      "text": "But when they saw the garden, they said, “We must have lost our way!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5298,
      "text": "Rather, we have been deprived.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5299,
      "text": "The best among them said, “Did I not say to you to glorify Allah[6]?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5300,
      "text": "They said, “Glory be to our Lord! We were truly wrongdoers.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5301,
      "text": "Then they turned to one another, throwing blame.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5302,
      "text": "They said, “Woe to us! We were surely transgressors.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5303,
      "text": "Our Lord may give us something better than this. We certainly turn to our Lord in hope[7].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5304,
      "text": "Such is the punishment [in this world]; but the punishment of the Hereafter is far worse, if only they knew.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5305,
      "text": "Indeed, the righteous will have gardens of bliss with their Lord.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5306,
      "text": "Should We then treat Muslims like the wicked?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5307,
      "text": "What is the matter with you that you make such a judgment?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5308,
      "text": "Or do you have a scripture in which you read",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5309,
      "text": "that you will be given whatever you choose?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5310,
      "text": "Or do you have a solemn promise binding upon Us until the Day of Resurrection, that you will have whatever you decide for yourselves?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5311,
      "text": "Ask them which of them can guarantee that.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5312,
      "text": "Or do they have associate-gods? Then let them bring forth their associate-gods[8], if they are truthful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5313,
      "text": "On the Day when the Shin [of Allah] will be uncovered[9], and they are invited to prostrate, but they will not be able to do so.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 565,
      "ruku": 499,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
